 Fix: Return a copy: `return ~action;` — or take ownership with the move marker `^`: `action: ^fn(*, force: Bool) Int`. There's no borrow-return in v1 — to share the value without a full copy, store an owned field, or reach for `Shared<T>`/`Id<T>` once a real program needs shared ownership
